  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a cataplana over medium heat, then add shallots and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, about 5 minutes",
    "add garlic and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute",
    "add chicken and cook, stirring occasionally, until browned, about 5 minutes",
    "add cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute",
    "add chicken broth and bring to a boil, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom of the pan",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, until chicken is cooked through, about 15 minutes",
    "stir in yogurt and pomegranate molasses, and cook, stirring occasionally, until sauce has thickened, about 5 minutes",
    "season with salt and pepper to taste",
    "serve hot, garnished with parsley"
  ],
